#
# AArch64 (ARM64) Linux syscall layer: raw syscall0..6 invocation via the `svc`
# instruction, generic-ABI syscall numbers, and operation wrappers. The AArch64
# generic syscall table omits the legacy open/stat/mkdir/... calls, so the
# operation wrappers translate them to their *at equivalents (openat, newfstatat,
# mkdirat, ...). Selected automatically via the compiler's "native" arch token
# (uranite.os.arch.native.syscall).
#
# This program is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify
